   561	  /**
   562	   * Route-command handler. Called when a user posts `/route <framework>`
   563	   * in a topic. The handler is responsible for persisting the new
   564	   * framework binding and triggering a respawn of the topic's session.
   565	   * Returns a short status string for the adapter to echo back to the
