   642	   * bot token + a relay available). Callers use this to skip work the HOLDER
   643	   * will do anyway: e.g. the `/telegram/reply` route skips its LOCAL tone gate
   644	   * for a relayed reply, because (a) the reply is already the agent's finalized
   645	   * output, (b) the Telegram-owning holder runs ITS tone gate on receipt, and
   646	   * (c) running the standby's tone gate adds a serial LLM call to every
