  5860	 * The summary/description blocks of an attention-item post, WITHOUT the
  5861	 * duplicated paragraph. Episode renderers (machine-coherence, rope probe)
  5862	 * conventionally build `description` as `${summary}\n\n${...}` — rendering
  5863	 * both repeated the same paragraph twice in every hub post (the 2026-07-11
