  5882	/**
  5883	 * Shared formatter wire-up used by both TelegramAdapter.apiCall and
  5884	 * TelegramLifeline.apiCall. Pure function for testability.
  5885	 *
  5886	 * For non-send methods, or when mode is undefined / `'legacy-passthrough'`,
  5887	 * returns params unchanged. For `sendMessage` / `editMessageText` in a
  5888	 * formatting mode, runs the formatter on `params.text` and overrides
  5889	 * `params.parse_mode` with the formatter's output.
