The live Bot API docs add an important cross-check: rich HTML supports media through `img`, `video`, and `audio` tags, and media must be in separate blocks. The local regexes are broader in some places and narrower in others, so I’m separating safety bypasses from over-refusal/claim drift before writing the verdict.
